senses.gloss:
(II)--a son of वेणुहोत्र and father of Gar- गभूमि, वंश and Vatsa--cursed Janamejaya;
1: Br. III. ६७. ७७-8; ६८. २१. वा. ९२. ७३-4.
the curse led to the destruction of the chariot presented to Rudra by ययाति; his son Lokagandha was put to trouble by the wicked king Janamejaya;
2: वा. ९३. २१.
a sage.
3: Ib. ३४. ६३.
